@token = {{$dotenv GITHUB_TOKEN}}
### GitHub: limit sa tokenom
GET https://api.github.com/rate_limit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Svi projekti
GET http://localhost:3000/projects

### Jedan projekat
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/euro-elite

### Novi projekat
POST http://localhost:3000/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "new-project",
  "title": "proba1",
  "description": "Moj lični sajt sa projektima.",
  "technologies": ["TypeScript", "React", "Node.js"],
  "githubUrl": "https://github.com/Vasic11/portfolio",
  "featured": true
}

### Neispravan projekat
POST http://localhost:3000/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "Moj Projekat",
  "titel": "x",
  "description": "kratko",
  "technologies": 5,
  "githubUrl": "nije-link",
  "featured": "da"
}

### Izmena
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/qa-testing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "QA i load testiranje"
}

### Neispravna izmena
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/qa-testing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "githubUrl": "nije-link"
}

### Brisanje
DELETE http://localhost:3000/projects/new-project

### Projekat iz organizacije
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/graffito

### Shell projekat
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/shell-data-pipeline


### GitHub: podaci o repou
GET https://api.github.com/repos/Vasic11/euro-elite

### GitHub: jezici
GET https://api.github.com/repos/Vasic11/euro-elite/languages


### Prijava
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "UNESI-LOZINKU"
}

### Da li sam prijavljen
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Odjava
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout

### GitHub: pinovani repoi (GraphQL)
POST https://api.github.com/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv GITHUB_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { viewer { login pinnedItems(first: 6, types: REPOSITORY) { nodes { ... on Repository { name url } } } } }"
}

### Pinovani repoi preko mog API-ja (treba prijava)
GET http://localhost:3000/github/pinned

